      "content": "Gun / cannon (OED s.v. gun 1a): a piece of ordnance, of iron or brass, in various sizes (from great cannon to the small 'base' and 'demi-hawk'), some breech-loading 'with chambers'. See also gunstone, gunpowder, hand gun, gune horn (powder-horn) and gonnelack (gunlock)."
    }
